alculation and represents the gross interest outlays for that year.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_b7fc8a98764e46f09e929b9a","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"todo__todo_write","arguments":{"content":"- [x] Find FFO-3 definition of gross interest in Treasury Bulletin\n- [x] Locate gross interest outlays for calendar year 1981\n- [x] Extract the nominal dollar amount in millions\n- [ ] Write answer to /app/answer.txt"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"todo"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
